For social icons configured via **Divi → Theme Options → General** (header/footer integration), add a small JavaScript snippet site-wide using `target='_blank'` and `rel='noopener noreferrer'`. 

**Option A: Quick fix (Polling)**
Paste into **Divi → Theme Options → Integration → Add code to the `<body>`**: 
```html
<script>
(function waitForJQuery() {
  if (typeof jQuery !== 'undefined') {
    jQuery(function($) {
      $('.et-social-icon a').attr({
