The Woo Product Tabs module renders multiple WooCommerce data types (description, attributes, shipping, reviews) in an organized, space-efficient tabbed layout.

**Usage:** Place the module below the product image and add-to-cart area. Include all tabs to replicate the standard WooCommerce structure. For simple products without configurable attributes, use the Included Tabs setting to show only Description and Reviews.

**Key Settings & Functionality:**
*   **Content Tab:** Controls which product's information is displayed (`Content` select). Use `Included Tabs` (multi-select) to choose visible tabs (Description, Additional Information, Shipping, Reviews).
*   **Design Tab:** Allows styling of the tab navigation labels (`Tab Text`) and the content within each panel (`Body Text`).
*   **Advanced Styling/Layout:** The module supports standard design options like Sizing, Spacing, Border, Box Shadow, Filters, Transform, and Animation.
*   **Code Hooks (PHP):**
    ```php
/* Filter the Woo Product Tabs module output */
add_filter('et_module_shortcode_output', function($output, $render_slug) {
    if ('et_pb_wc_tabs' !== $render_slug) {
        return $output;
    }
    // Modify output as needed
    return $output;
}, 10, 2);

/* Add a custom tab to WooCommerce product tabs */
add_filter('woocommerce_product_tabs', function($tabs) {
    $tabs['shipping_info'] = array(
        'title'    => 'Shipping Info',
        'priority' => 25,
        'callback' => function() {
            echo '<h2>Shipping Information</h2>';
            echo '<p>Free shipping on orders over $50. Standard delivery 3-5 business days.</p>';
        }
    );
    return $tabs;
});

/* Reorder WooCommerce product tabs */
add_filter('woocommerce_product_tabs', function($tabs) {
    if (isset($tabs['reviews'])) {
        $tabs['reviews']['priority'] = 5; // Move reviews to first position
    }
    return $tabs;
});
